    "title": "Photo: Chip off the block - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Singson ,\n2 hours ago Josh Cremeens of Jacksonville stands on a scaffold as he scrapes away paint from the facade of 310 E. State St. Cremeens was out Tuesday working above A Touch of Class Salon and Spa, which is part of the East State Street building. (Ben Singson/Journal-Courier) Sign up for Jacksonville Journal-Courier newsletters here\nRead the original article on myjournalcourier.com",
